# Server-side only. Never place these values in browser/VITE_ variables.
# Store real values in Lovable's encrypted Secrets form, never in committed files.
# BIFROST_URL: public HTTPS gateway base address (optionally ending in /v1).
# BIFROST_API_KEY: Bifrost virtual key sent via x-bf-vk.
# Model names must match routes/providers configured in your gateway.

TAVILY_API_KEY=
BIFROST_URL=
BIFROST_API_KEY=
EXTRACT_MODEL=
JUDGE_MODEL=
